# raw capture masters (unbrewed-p2p-504)
# Screen-capture masters get dropped straight into public/pro/ and are tens of
# megabytes; only the encoded, web-sized derivatives belong in git. The single
# `*` deliberately does not cross a `/`, so the encoded hero clips one level
# down in public/pro/hero/ stay tracked — as do marketing/public/clips/*.mp4.
public/pro/*.mp4

